\left( \boldsymbol{\varphi }_{2}\right)%
\end{array}%
\right) ,
\end{eqnarray}%
where 
\begin{equation}
\mathcal{R}_{\left( \boldsymbol{\varphi }_{1},\boldsymbol{\varphi }%
_{2}\right) }\left( \overline{\mathfrak{R}_{\left( \boldsymbol{\varphi }_{1},%
\boldsymbol{\varphi }_{2}\right) }\left( T\right) }\right) =\overline{%
\mathcal{R}_{\left( \boldsymbol{\varphi }_{1},\boldsymbol{\varphi }%
_{2}\right) }\left( T\right) }.
\end{equation}
\end{enumerate}
\end{enumerate}
\end{remark}

\begin{remark}
Recall the definition of the real inear map $\Upsilon \in \mathcal{B}_{%
\mathbb{R}}\left( \mathcal{A},\mathfrak{H}_{\mathbb{C}}\right) $ is 
\begin{equation}
\Upsilon \left( v\right) =\Upsilon \left( v_{1},v_{2}\right) =\Upsilon
\left( v_{1}\oplus _{\mathbb{C}}v_{2}\right) =\Upsilon \left(
v_{1}+v_{2}\right) =\mathfrak{s}^{\dagger }\left( v_{1}\right) +\mathfrak{s}%
\left( v_{2}\right) .
\end{equation}
\end{remark}

\begin{definition}
Of the complex linear map $\limfunc{Adj}\in \mathcal{B}\left( \mathcal{B}%
\left( \overset{}{\mathcal{B}\left( \mathcal{A}_{1}\right) ,\mathcal{B}%
\left( \mathfrak{H}_{\mathbb{C}}\right) }\right) ,\mathcal{B}_{\mathbb{R}%
}\left( \mathcal{A}_{1},\mathfrak{H}_{\mathbb{C}}\right) \right) $ 
\begin{equation}
\limfunc{Adj}:\mathcal{B}_{\mathbb{R}}\left( \mathcal{A}_{1},\mathfrak{H}_{%
\mathbb{C}}\right) \rightarrow \mathcal{B}\left( \overset{}{\mathcal{B}%
\left( \mathcal{A}_{1}\right) ,\mathcal{B}\left( \mathfrak{H}_{\mathbb{C}%
}\right) }\right)
\end{equation}%
by%
\begin{equation}
\left[ \limfunc{Adj}\left( \Upsilon \right) \right] \left( T\right) =%
\widehat{\Upsilon }\left( T\right) =\Upsilon T\Upsilon ^{-1}\,=T_{\mathcal{A}%
_{1}}\forall T\in \mathcal{B}\left( \mathfrak{H}_{\mathbb{C}}\right)
,\Upsilon \in \mathcal{B}_{\mathbb{R}}\left( \mathcal{A}_{1},\mathfrak{H}_{%
\mathbb{C}}\right) \,.
\end{equation}
\end{definition}

\begin{notation}
\begin{equation}
\left[ \limfunc{Adj}\left( \Upsilon \right) \right] \left( T\right) =%
\widehat{\Upsilon }\left( T\right) =\Upsilon T\Upsilon ^{-1}=T_{\mathcal{A}%
_{1}}.
\end{equation}
\end{notation}

\begin{remark}
\begin{enumerate}
\item $T\in \mathcal{B}\left( \mathfrak{H}_{\mathbb{C}}\right) $

\item $\left[ \limfunc{Adj}\left( \Upsilon \right) \right] \left( T\right)
=T_{\mathcal{A}_{1}}\in \mathcal{B}\left( \mathcal{A}_{1}\right) $

\item $\Upsilon \in \mathcal{B}\left( \mathcal{A}_{1},\mathfrak{H}_{\mathbb{C%
}}\right) ,$ and $\Upsilon ^{-1}\in \mathcal{B}\left( \mathfrak{H}_{\mathbb{C%
}},\mathcal{A}_{1}\right) $

\item $\limfunc{Adj}\left( \Upsilon \right) \in \mathcal{B}\left( \mathcal{B}%
\left( \mathcal{A}_{1}\right) ,\mathcal{B}\left( \mathfrak{H}_{\mathbb{C}%
}\right) \right) $

\item $\limfunc{Adj}\in \mathcal{B}\left( \overset{}{\mathcal{B}\left( 
\overset{}{\mathcal{B}\left( \mathcal{A}_{1}\right) ,\mathcal{B}\left( 
\mathfrak{H}_{\mathbb{C}}\right) }\right) ,\mathcal{B}_{\mathbb{R}}\left( 
\mathcal{A}_{1},\mathfrak{H}_{\mathbb{C}}\right) }\right) $
\end{enumerate}
\end{remark}

\begin{remark}
\begin{enumerate}
\item 
\begin{equation}
\Upsilon :\mathfrak{H}_{\mathbb{C}}\rightarrow \mathcal{A}_{1},\quad
\Upsilon \in \mathcal{B}_{\mathbb{R}}\left( \mathcal{A}_{1},\mathfrak{H}_{%
\mathbb{C}}\right)
\end{equation}

\item 
\begin{equation}
T:\mathfrak{H}_{\mathbb{C}}\rightarrow \mathfrak{H}_{\mathbb{C}},\quad T\in 
\mathcal{B}\left( \mathfrak{H}_{\mathbb{C}}\right)
\end{equation}

\item 
\begin{equation}
\left[ \limfunc{Adj}\left( \Upsilon \right) \right] \left( T\right) :%
\mathcal{A}_{1}\rightarrow \mathcal{A}_{1},\quad \left[ \limfunc{Adj}\left(
\Upsilon \right) \right] \left( T\right) \in \mathcal{B}\left( \mathcal{A}%
_{1}\right)
\end{equation}

\item 
\begin{equation}
\limfunc{Adj}\left( \Upsilon \right) :\mathcal{B}\left( \mathfrak{H}_{%
\mathbb{C}}\right) \rightarrow \mathcal{B}\left( \mathcal{A}_{1}\right)
,\quad \limfunc{Adj}\left( \Upsilon \right) \in \mathcal{B}\left( \overset{}{%
\mathcal{B}\left( \mathcal{A}_{1}\right) ,\mathcal{B}\left( \mathfrak{H}_{%
\mathbb{C}}\right) }\right)
\end{equation}

\item 
\begin{equation}
\limfunc{Adj}:\mathcal{B}_{\mathbb{R}}\left( \mathcal{A}_{1},\mathfrak{H}_{%
\mathbb{C}}\right) \rightarrow \mathcal{B}\left( \overset{}{\mathcal{B}%
\left( \overset{}{\mathcal{B}\left( \mathcal{A}_{1}\right) ,\mathcal{B}%
\left( \mathfrak{H}_{\mathbb{C}}\right) }\right) ,\mathcal{B}_{\mathbb{R}%
}\left( \mathcal{A}_{1},\mathfrak{H}_{\mathbb{C}}\right) }\right)
\end{equation}
\end{enumerate}
\end{remark}

\begin{remark}
This gives 
\begin{equation}
\left[ \limfunc{Adj}\left( \Upsilon \right) \right] \left( T\right) =%
\widehat{\Upsilon }\left( T\right) \left( \Upsilon \left( v\right) \right)
=\Upsilon \left( Tv\right) =\left[ \Upsilon T\right] \left( v\right) =\left[
\Upsilon T\Upsilon ^{-1}\Upsilon \right] \left( v\right) =T_{\mathcal{A}%
_{1}}\left( \Upsilon \left( v\right) \right)
\end{equation}%
and 
\begin{equation}
\widehat{\Upsilon }\left( T\right) \left( \mathfrak{s}^{\dagger }\left(
v_{1}\right) +\mathfrak{s}\left( v_{2}\right) \right) =T_{\mathcal{A}%
_{1}}\left( \mathfrak{s}^{\dagger }\left( v_{1}\right) +\mathfrak{s}\left(
v_{2}\right) \right) =\mathfrak{s}^{\dagger }\left( Tv_{1}\right) +\mathfrak{%
s}\left( Tv_{2}\right) =\widehat{\Upsilon }\left( T\right) \mathfrak{s}%
^{\dagger }\left( v_{1}\right) +\widehat{\Upsilon }\left( T\right) \mathfrak{%
s}\left( v_{2}\right) .
\end{equation}
\end{remark}

