_{1}}\mathcal{\alpha }_{2}\right\} f\left( x_{1}x_{2}\right) +2i\func{Im}%
\left\{ \overline{\mathcal{\alpha }_{1}}\mathcal{\alpha }_{3}\right\}
f\left( x_{1}x_{3}\right) \\
&&+2i\func{Im}\left\{ \overline{\mathcal{\alpha }_{1}}\mathcal{\alpha }%
_{4}\right\} f\left( x_{1}x_{4}\right) +2i\func{Im}\left\{ \overline{%
\mathcal{\alpha }_{2}}\mathcal{\alpha }_{3}\right\} f\left(
x_{2}x_{3}\right) +2i\func{Im}\left\{ \overline{\mathcal{\alpha }_{2}}%
